        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86232, Tuscany Bronze Fluted Cabinet Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its eye-catching classic design, the Tuscany Bronze Fluted Bin Pull is the rustic touch you were looking for to finish off your kitchen remodel. The Tuscany Bronze Fluted Cabinet Cup Pull is available in flat black bronze and medium bronze finish colors. Choose from 3 inch or 4 inch sizes. The Tuscan Fluted Cabinet Bin Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. Also see the matching <a href=\"/products/twist-tuscany-bronze-cabinet-pull-emtek-86103\">Twist Tuscany Bronze Cabinet Pull</a> to complete the look!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Tuscany Bronze Bin Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86232-specifications.pdf?v=1704262413\"><b>Emtek Tuscany Bronze Fluted Bin Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86232:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection\" 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86233:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection\" 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
